{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"jfj-e-p024a","title":"裴松之反驳陈寿对蒋费治理之评","order":7854,"accounts":[{"id":"jfj-a-p024a","label":"裴松之按","text":"裴松之反驳陈寿对蒋费治理之评","evidence":["jfj-q0253"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"逐条保留原时间；未从邻段自动继承公元年。","evidence":["jfj-q0253"]},"ordering_evidence":"jfj-q0253","related_events":[{"event":"jfj-e-o058a","type":"disputes","evidence":["jfj-q0253","jfj-q0210"]}]},{"id":"jfj-e-o058a","title":"陈寿评蒋琬费祎姜维","order":7853,"accounts":[{"id":"jfj-a-o058a","label":"正文","text":"陈寿评蒋琬费祎姜维","evidence":["jfj-q0210"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"逐条保留原时间；未从邻段自动继承公元年。","evidence":["jfj-q0210"]},"ordering_evidence":"jfj-q0210","related_events":[{"event":"jfj-e-p024a","type":"disputes","evidence":["jfj-q0253","jfj-q0210"]},{"event":"jfj-e-p025a","type":"related","evidence":["jfj-q0254","jfj-q0210"]}]}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0210","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-e982da11f9fc2ecd4380","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：蒋琬方整有威重，费祎宽济而博爱；咸承诸葛之成规，因循而不革。是以边境无虞，邦家和一；然犹未尽治小之宜〖1〗，居静之理也。﹝一﹞姜维粗有文武，志立功名；而玩众黩旅〖2〗，明断不周：终致陨毙。《老子》有云：“治大国者犹烹小鲜〖3〗。”况于区区蕞尔〖4〗，而可屡扰乎哉？﹝二﹞","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":281,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0253","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-93c5ad71dd1667dbc6c9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：蒋、费为相，克遵画一；未尝徇功妄动，有所亏丧；外却骆谷之师，内保宁缉之实。“治小之宜，居静之理”，何以过于此哉！今讥“未尽”而不著其事，故使览者不知所谓也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":288,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5616c407a434cbe6a755","start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
